{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08995","headline":"赠卢嵩 · 韦应物","name":"赠卢嵩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百川注东海，东海无虚盈。\n泥滓不能浊，澄波非益清。\n恬然自安流，日照万里晴。\n云物不隐象，三山共分明。\n奈何疾风怒，忽若砥柱倾。\n海水虽无心，洪涛亦相惊。\n怒号在倏忽，谁识变化情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}